When `complete_before_event` is not set, we are not passing the `completeBefore` keyword argument to the Koji wrapper. As a consequence, a timestamp is getting auto assigned as follows:
```
            elif method_name == 'listBuilds':
                if 'completeBefore' not in kwargs and 'createdBefore' not in kwargs:
                    kwargs = kwargs or {}
                    kwargs['completeBefore'] = self.___before_timestamp
```
This has been acting as a filter to our build search, preventing us from picking up the latest news in some cases

This is breaking the UI - we cannot click next/back buttons.

I wil rewrite this properly.

